  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🔎 準備好探索海洋吧，這次有超多值得一看的內容、戰利品、驚喜、生物、結構與考古遺跡，一定要做好準備！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🧭 在海洋最深處尋找城市，探索各式各樣的房間，裡面有不同種類的沉屍。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌊 海洋變得更加有趣，擁有許多新的小型遺跡，甚至還有化石，祝你好運探索所有地方，這將是一大挑戰！做好準備吧</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">與世界生成資料包相容，也能在 Paper/Spigot 上運行（請務必備份，因為 Paper 有時會有問題）<br></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>回報錯誤、提供意見，甚至協助我開發，我們有&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> </span>來做這些，我們這裡的人都很好！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/632622?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">相容於</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BuWCQzqf/images/ec4c74e592122ec4dba421f0dc6b345351ee9c35.png\" alt=\"縮圖\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xtNJCT8.png\" alt=\"海洋模組圖片\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WcCdBUb.png\" alt=\"海洋模組圖片\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/theTCWH.png\" alt=\"海洋模組圖片\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CvoQVv8.png\" alt=\"海洋模組圖片\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZlGBHE.png\" alt=\"海洋模組圖片\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Oi4LX7H.png\" alt=\"海洋模組圖片\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#008000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>戰利品類型</strong></span><br></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0cf\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jv5vYXd.png\" alt=\"Hopo Better Underwater Ruins「城市、遺跡、化石、考古等！」Minecraft 資料包\"><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExN3pubjlmY201MnBkZTY1bHhvd2s3YmNvcGtocWs0ZGwwYmVkeWw2ciZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/1ajydm9mcGi0MvnQhR/giphy.gif\" alt=\"動畫 GIF\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4alRrb.png\" alt=\"Hopo Better Underwater Ruins「城市、遺跡、化石、考古等！」Minecraft 資料包\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0cf\"><strong><img src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExdDdnb2tzM2gwdGF5emt2NjR0c3B5NmFrNHJkZTh1YjJzbjNlOXN3OCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/1EPyJejgMpmeqMfOYi/giphy.gif\" alt=\"動畫 GIF\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BwJilvN.png\"><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExbm1oMnd5NTMzb294ZnAzdzR2bTN3eHhtbDRodDEyZW96dHZidDMxaCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/FphX1uE3zpMW7UiggZ/giphy.gif\" alt=\"動畫 GIF\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0cf\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7EVVp2v.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px